    "그럼 '%@'%@ 향해서,\n내일 바로 해낼 수 있을 만큼 작은 일 하나는 뭘까?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Und was wäre auf dem Weg zu „%1$@“%2$@ eine Sache, die so klein ist, dass du sie gleich morgen schaffst?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So, toward '%1$@' —\nwhat is one thing small enough to finish tomorrow?%2$@"
