    "야식을 참지 못했어요. 배고파서 라면을 먹었습니다." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ich konnte nicht widerstehen. Ich hatte Hunger und habe Instantnudeln gegessen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't resist a late-night snack. Got hungry and had ramen."
